  "body": "Part of #12994 and #12989, we would like a stream that workers can follow to be notified of rooms becoming un-partial-stated. This includes their use in sync tokens for non-lazy-loading syncers.\r\n\r\nBear in mind the stream may have multiple writers in the future — that said, it's very possible that we can just bounce writes through the master since it won't be a high-traffic stream.\r\n",
